<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's net profit up 20.6 pct in H1/96.</title>
<headline>Morocco's net profit up 20.6 pct in H1/96.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's largest private conglomerate ONA Group, posted a consolidated net profit of 328.6 million dirhams ($37.7 million) in the first half of the year, up 20.6 percent over the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>ONA registered 272.4 million dirhams net profit in the first half of 1995, the group said in a statement faxed to Reuters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The figures were released after a meeting of ONA's board of directors, it said.</p>
